@startuml
|User|
start
:Initiate diagnostic run;

|Automated Diagnostic Tool|
:Obtain sensed data\n(temperatures, pressures,\nelectrical current, machine state, etc.);
if (Sensed data available\nin real time?) then (yes)
  :Acquire sensed data in real time\nfrom data acquisition hardware;
else (no)
  :Retrieve previously acquired sensed data\nfrom data acquisition hardware;
endif

:Obtain fixed data describing subsystem\n(specifications, design info,\noperating characteristics, set points);
:Load fixed data from permanent storage;

:Preprocess data:\nreduce, filter, prepare;
:Perform statistical processing as needed\n(averaging, trending, etc.);

:Run diagnostic algorithms\n(derived from expert practices);
:Detect and identify faults\nin HVAC subsystems;

fork
  :Prepare results for display\n(graphical + textual);
  |User|
  :View diagnostic results;
fork again
  |Automated Diagnostic Tool|
  :Record diagnostic results;
  :Store results to permanent storage\nfor subsequent retrieval and analysis;
end fork

stop
@enduml